<title>UK: NordLB sets 10 billion peseta bond due 2001.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets 10 billion peseta bond due 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banco Central Hispano Americano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     5.60	MATURITY    04.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.17    PAY DATE    04.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/IBCA AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
